    - rid: 2623125860895687581
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b5a2bd5de8484df695e30e23d57c57f1
        position: {x: 640, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Steady now. It is a fine morning to walk into something stupid.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687582
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1c7614c9b03f4156804e4368a8c8d647
        position: {x: 340, y: 740}
        reaches: 0.3
    - rid: 2623125860895687583
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7bb297e257754f6ba6a7719e5603de5e
        position: {x: 640, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A shepherd told me his dogs won't go past the tree line any more. Dogs. I have seen those dogs go after a bear.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687584
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 63bc469d8e9b444bb1efb26f9e86a3fd
        position: {x: 340, y: 910}
        reaches: 0.58
    - rid: 2623125860895687585
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3ce36e22feed446f9cb8da5d40dd801e
        position: {x: 640, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Rumours grow in the telling. That is why we go and look, instead of sitting in a longhouse and listening.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687586
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b4e0b1d675714e279e4c69b383901254
        position: {x: 340, y: 1080}
        reaches: 0.85
    - rid: 2623125860895687587
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 132a3ad2e7c242d09d9ac29f95731622
        position: {x: 640, y: 910}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Is it past noon already? We have not been walking an hour.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687588
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c41a0424ec2b4c4e8ca5d538cbf850c9
        position: {x: 640, y: 1080}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Hold up. That's Bjarne's handcart, tipped off the road. Have a look; I'll watch the trees.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687589
      type: {class: WaitForEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 998691c5689d4959bfe347d6d6dab31e
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1822e4f3d74228b489493e550b28c6ca, type: 2}
        orAfterSeconds: 25
    - rid: 2623125860895687590
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1069bdbe01484e3592792d63ba9552b3
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever happened here, it was quick, and it was not here that it ended. We go on.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687591
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
