        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623125860895687488
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1d4a7840ecf54f598d6a71597571e205
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82ba4d914072adf478d4fa857f205026, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687489
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 84257ab4964b40edb38d9233ff89d008
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: You asked me by the fire, so here it is. I have seen stones like these wake once. It took everyone who stood too near, and it put them somewhere else. Ingrid knew that when she came. Now you do.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687490
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ba7daf937a0b4d039bb85682135def12
        position: {x: 940, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone. There are things I should have told you, and there is no time left to tell them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687491
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8ee376564d1149339caa1bfc04d7476f
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 316e769a318ba5a44b33770cbaf45924, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687492
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a6b89d1188b74aa3bb0819309286ff7e
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>The same marks as the stone by the lake, and the same warmth. It was already awake this morning.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
