  meadowLine: 
  forestLine: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
  campLine: I came to examine the old iron markers. Whatever protects the road has cracked. Steel will help tonight, but steel alone will not mend this.
  portalLine: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
  campTopics: []
  morningTopics: []
  alchemist: 0
  lowHealth: 0.5
  healShare: 0.35
  supportInterval: 6
