--- !u!114 &983162864
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 983162858}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2bf080be06a0e604cb9cf97b1f099a15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestGiver
  quest: {fileID: 0}
  greeting: 
  waitingLines:
    lines: []
    order: 0
  turnInText: 
  afterLines:
    lines:
    - Hold together! Nobody gets left behind. We will find each other, whatever happens.
    order: 0
  showMarker: 1
  offers:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3514f440e604ac048bb77179757dee9b, type: 2}
    text: There you are. Come and stand by the fire with the rest of us. You should know who you are walking with before we set out.
    acceptText: Tell me.
    waitingText: Finish your porridge and listen. This is the only quiet you will get today.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f630af2f0eaf434a97dc64ffe2d130c, type: 2}
    text: 'The packs are tied and the fire is nearly out. Ingrid''s party should have been back yesterday, and the forest is half a morning down the road. If you have anything left to do here, do it now: once we set out, we do not come back for it. Are you ready?'
    acceptText: I'm ready. Let's go.
    waitingText: Stay on the road. We keep a steady pace, and the others will wait if you fall behind.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7782d364f6bf30b4ba50ba576e7be27f, type: 2}
    text: 
    acceptText: It's done.
    waitingText: Take what suits you. Nobody goes further unarmed.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0279feb93b7c8b74e9fd8683d9d10fd3, type: 2}
    text: That was no weather. The sun went down hours early and this storm came out of a clear sky. Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv walked into this two days ago, so we go on, not back. Keep your torch up and follow the old road into the trees. Find us dry shelter; we will follow you.
    acceptText: I will find us shelter.
    waitingText: Follow the old road to the rock shelter, then come back to me.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4f625534621489e4183de610d93d4f36, type: 2}
    text: Dry stone overhead. Good work. We need warmth before anyone can think clearly. Gather eight Sticks and twelve Small Rocks nearby; there is loose fuel on the forest floor.
    acceptText: I will gather the supplies.
    waitingText: Gather eight Sticks and twelve Small Rocks nearby, then return to me.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ba326763b19a9e46be36507850aed82, type: 2}
    text: That is enough. Let us put your building skills to use. Press G to open Build, choose Campfire and place it on open ground beside the shelter. The supplies you collected will pay for it.
    acceptText: I will build the campfire.
    waitingText: Press G, choose Campfire and place it on open ground beside the shelter.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 83fc380c709c01a4383dfa7c9300d48a, type: 2}
    text: 'Eirik: Warm hands, empty bellies. There are berry bushes in the clearing west of the shelter. Pick five and stew them over the fire; take my waterskin for the pot.'
    acceptText: It's done.
    waitingText: Pick five berries west of the shelter, stew them at the campfire, then return to me.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2306560eba5c594886d38a592bdb05d, type: 2}
    text: A fire and a warm meal. Sit, talk to the others, get your breath back. Whatever is out there will still be there when we are done.
    acceptText: Let us catch our breath.
    waitingText: Sit. Talk to the others. We have earned this, however long it lasts.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd536373f8f639f4db60c8810e546ebf, type: 2}
    text: 
    acceptText: It's done.
    waitingText: Keep to the old road north until you reach the ancient waystones, then speak to me.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5699d07d5ceee6144855cc88c1a5f255, type: 2}
    text: These markings are older than the road. Sigrid says they may be a way out, and does not say how she knows. Touch the waystones and see if they still answer. We will hold the clearing.
    acceptText: I will try the waystones.
    waitingText: Touch the centre waystone to start the connection. We will defend the clearing.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  sideOffers: []
  speakerName: Sigrid
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueCameraDistance: 0.65
