        when: 0
        alsoAfterLoading: 1
    - rid: 2623125862064848913
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 48d6d42f52ea4c4c892dbb2a8e70941b
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 367a938ebe0a9f847806fbc01218a5e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125862064848914
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 97102941428e41cc9ec03c1a78bdd96e
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 0.4
    - rid: 2623125862064848915
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c7fd7a673fd64f9a921e41393f4d9554
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: 'For anyone who slept through last night''s talk, and I know who you are: I am Sigrid, and we walk east today. The villages asked what is wrong in that forest. Two days ago I sent Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv ahead to look. They should have been back yesterday.'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848916
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4ffa205a378c4a618f2fb6bce07babf2
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Eirik. Twenty winters in the shield wall at Granheim. I walk in front, I carry the heavy things and I make sure everyone eats. There is porridge. It is bad.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848917
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 70036c70aaa4492fa0202583a4a1ca86
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Runa. I find the tracks, and I shoot what makes them. Trolls off their crags, witches on the roads, wolves that don't run from fire. I want to see it for myself before I believe any of it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848918
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b26fe0b3788f4b0e8f61abb82ef05a98
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: And you. You came to us with a strong back and few questions. Nobody walks towards that forest by accident. Why are you here?
        answers:
        - For the coin.
        - Someone I know went in there.
        - To see if the stories are true.
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623125862064848919
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: eb1d2b7f85ed4df0943dd8a0064b39d1
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 052e1548b0a161348bb7cf591b4333f7, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125862064848920
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 89e5e7c6c13846d59df1d84115c92704
        position: {x: 2140, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a0301acf429304ba7ad3d189da48bb, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125862064848921
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5b6391a660ea40eca563fdfa3d0d9a20
        position: {x: 2140, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1426971087cd5fb408c55293cb5e4e12, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125862064848922
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9fbcfa9e47fd4bed9d7336919a631900
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: An honest answer. I like you already.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848923
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 35f62115122d4e8d8b5fafcc84dd10a4
        position: {x: 2440, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Then we are after the same thing. We will find them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848924
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: af6cc6025d844b4ea18885c7bcf9660f
        position: {x: 2440, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Careful. The ones who go looking for the truth of it are the ones who find it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848925
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d0869a3125d74f9abb18645a514f09db
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: We leave when you are ready. If you want to earn your porridge first, ask the others. They always have something.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125862064848926
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: afa3ed5289be4a85ad81b246e12dfa34
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 367a938ebe0a9f847806fbc01218a5e2, type: 2}
