    - rid: 2623125860895687644
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 027b4ce59b8c4f1c859818faed099f92
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623125860895687645
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e8474aef5c9f4575a3a26ca54cea33c1
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: That storm came out of a clear sky. I have been a soldier twenty years and I have never seen the sun simply leave.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687646
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5fcb998a3e42431ba806e2fb75293698
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever waits in there, you should not meet it with your bare hands. We carry spare arms in the packs. They are old and they are plain, but they will do. Take what suits you.
        answers:
        - The sword.
        - The axe.
        - The spear.
        - The club.
        - The bow.
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687647
      type: {class: GiveItemsNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: faf07444abc4477eb910782e50d96cdf
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
