    - rid: 2623125860895687652
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c64d98c46e454d8fb74f8043421b8d3c
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687653
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 774082a08b64440b9cf443351d97cd27
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A soldier's choice. It is old iron, but it holds an edge. Guard well and let them come to you.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687654
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7537d62c209e4a6d8da07b5c350c062a
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687655
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0b9b13ba0ad546b3a9a722227c968344
        position: {x: 2140, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and you keep the torch in your other hand.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687656
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 72ff943430b64aeb9a652e33e60d8981
        position: {x: 1840, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687657
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2ae581409f4d46808eed9a8f8621c647
        position: {x: 2140, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Long reach, and it wants both hands, so your torch goes in your pack. Press L to swap them when you need the light.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687658
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 20c7b1afd27b4b6aafe51b163faf6599
        position: {x: 1840, y: 570}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687659
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 825b1abbdbf741b8b131db0ef3c0c25b
        position: {x: 2140, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Simple. I respect that. Hit it until it stops, and you keep the torch in your other hand.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687660
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5a25048d272046f09016b5901a717b3f
        position: {x: 1840, y: 740}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687661
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e2bd97309be34614b5efcb59591b7758
        position: {x: 2140, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A bow! Then there are two of us. It wants both hands, so your torch went into your pack. Press L to swap bow and torch whenever you need the light. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
