  resident: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 272895da9ba7e784b8a97bcd2be637c8, type: 2}
  meadowLine: 
  forestLine: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
  campLine: The plants are wrong. Roots that should sleep in this season are warm to the touch. Something is feeding the enchantment. Stay close; I brought a little medicine.
  portalLine: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
  campTopics: []
  morningTopics: []
  alchemist: 1
  lowHealth: 0.5
  healShare: 0.35
  supportInterval: 6
  supportReach: 12
  healLines:
  - Hold still. Drink this.
  - You're bleeding. Here.
  - Not yet, you don't. Drink.
